vulnerability contained in the product or a severe incident having an impact on
its security:

| Deadline | Notification | Recipients |
|---|---|---|
| 24 hours from becoming aware | Early warning | CSIRT designated as coordinator, and ENISA |
| 72 hours from becoming aware | Vulnerability or incident notification, with corrective or mitigating measures taken | CSIRT designated as coordinator, and ENISA |
| 14 days (vulnerability) / 1 month (incident) | Final report | CSIRT designated as coordinator, and ENISA |

